  "canonicalOwner": "parseEnergyExpenditure, calculateSummary and existing settings.save own validation and calculations. targetPolicy.expenditure changes expenditure only. Preview and save share prepareTargetPolicyCommand; the existing owner-scoped workspace receipt owns writes.",
  "behavior": [
    "Source cards, baseline level/Custom picker, Default/Custom BMR, TEF, help, daily expenditure ring, and component rows.",
    "Respect kcal/kJ and preserve missing/zero values. Setup leaves existing fixed calorie target intact; updates preserve active goal/display or inactive goal under custom energy.",
    "Remove Health Connect and activity-device controls per the PWA decision.",
    "Keep editor drafts on preview failure; closing an editor aborts pending preview before save. No write on cancellation.",
    "Validate canonical preview before immutable workspace command. Retry the same request after transport/5xx uncertainty. Reject stale revisions and reload persisted values."
